{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a62de729-0a5a-8f52-839d-a89d7af46811",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:06:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Alan Sherman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:59:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:59:17-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hey hon, yeah, hi. My name's Alan Sherman. I'm calling about a dip in the road, kind of a pothole but not exactly. Can you hear me okay? I'm in the car and the reception's lousy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:59:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're a little choppy but I've got you. Go ahead, Alan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T12:59:56-05:00",
      "duration": 39,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So there was a utility trench dug up on my street a while back, they patched it, and now it's settled. It left a dip right down the middle of the patch. [line breaks up] and it got worse after that nor'easter that ended Saturday, two days ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:00:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out there. You said it got worse after the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:00:46-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, yeah, after the storm. Rain sat in it all weekend. It's a trench patch that sank, that's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:01:02-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. A sunken utility patch. What street is it on, and the number nearest it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:01:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "370 Mill Street. Up on the Hill, Historic Hill. Mill Street, M-I-L-L."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:01:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "370 Mill Street, perfect. And how big are we talking? Is it deep, wide?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:01:37-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's about two feet across. Not crazy deep, maybe a few inches, but you feel it when you go over it. Cars hit it and it bangs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:01:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it in the travel lane or over by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:02:09-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Travel lane, pretty much right in front of the house. [inaudible] parked cars have to swerve a little around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:02:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, say that last part again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:02:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said people swerve around it. Nobody wants to drop a wheel in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:02:44-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Let me get this down. Settled utility trench, about two feet across, a few inches deep, travel lane in front of 370 Mill Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:03:04-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. So can you add the street to the repair list? I just want it on there so somebody comes and fills it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:03:24-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll put it in as a request for the repair list. The crews have been working through a bunch of storm reports, so it'll go in the queue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:03:48-05:00",
      "duration": 30,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, no rush, as long as it's on there. Honestly I'm watching every dollar right now, I overspent on the holiday gifts, little embarrassed about it, so I'd hate to blow a tire on top of that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:18-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You and about half the city this week. Don't be embarrassed. Do you want a callback when it's scheduled?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that'd be great. My number's 401-555-0166."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0166. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the name again was Alan Sherman?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alan Sherman, S-H-E-R-M-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:04:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Anything else on that block, other potholes, anything near it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:05:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I've seen. Just that one dip. Oh, [crosstalk] sorry, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:05:17-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you go. I was just going to say I'll note it as a utility patch settlement, since that sometimes gets handled a bit differently than a regular pothole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:05:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, whatever gets it filled. Does it matter who dug it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:05:50-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can, if it's a utility's patch. The crew will look at it and sort that out, you don't have to do anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:06:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. That's all I needed, hon. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:06:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Alan. Drive safe, and watch that dip until they get there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:06:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Take care."
    }
  ],
